                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "This page checks whether the figures are trustworthy and which practices are genuinely different \u2014 not random noise.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12px",
                      "fontWeight": "normal",
                      "color": "#425563"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "1. Pick a CVDPREVENT indicator (top).",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11px",
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "color": "#222222"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "2. Funnel & control chart: each point is a practice's care gap vs the Gloucestershire average. Inside the funnel = normal variation. Above the top line = significantly worse; below the bottom line = better. Larger practices sit tighter (more certain).",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12px",
                      "fontWeight": "normal",
                      "color": "#425563"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "3. Practice table: each practice's Wilson 95% confidence interval and funnel status \u2014 High up-arrow / Low down-arrow / outlier means statistically significant.",
